{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "purpose": "Decision support for Draw Things CLI SDXL image generation using only the assets enumerated by the user.",
  "compatibility_notes": [
    "config-json is a partial override merged with model-recommended configuration; explicit CLI flags override config values.",
    "Sampler integer IDs are Draw Things SamplerType raw values; validate after updating draw-things-cli.",
    "Exact model, LoRA and upscaler identifiers must match files/metadata registered by the local Draw Things installation.",
    "For unregistered local LoRAs, current CLI documentation says loras[].version may be required; add the version label expected by the local catalog/metadata rather than guessing if the CLI errors.",
    "Hires fix performs a second diffusion pass and can alter geometry or contours; for strict line art consider direct native-size rendering without hires fix.",
    "No generated text in educational diagrams should be treated as authoritative; typeset labels separately."
  ],
